algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: TropicalMatMul(A, B)
Input: n×n matrices A, B over ℝ ∪ {∞}
Output: n×n matrix C = A ⊗ B

for i = 1 to n:
  for j = 1 to n:
    C[i,j] = ∞
    for k = 1 to n:
      C[i,j] = min(C[i,j], A[i,k] + B[k,j])
return C

Time: O(n³), Space: O(n²)
Correctness: Verified by tropicalMatMul_assoc theorem
